From 2688526abe0f9c7ccbb1b006aade9fab4fc1409c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:56:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] proto: P2a-T1+T2 checked plan hides private names; B3 on
 the checked side

T1: prepareEvalPlan splits the collector's private names off materializedNames (privateSlots
records their publication slots; checkPreparedBindings expects the publication sequence minus
them). T2: PlanBindings.definedNames + InputBindingError.inputIsDefined, raised by packBodyOf
and unpackBodyOf. Migrated CompileTest repeat block and ordered twin, DifferentialTest
repeated-assignment case, Adapter32Test fixture 4; new Eval.Plan.CollectPlanTest (f64 + f32).
Combined commit: both tasks edit the same PlanBindings/Adapter code.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
